      "name": "fresh dill",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the comal over medium heat",
    "Roll out the filo dough to a large sheet",
    "Spread the confit tomato over the center of the dough, leaving a 1-inch border",
    "Arrange the tiger prawns on top of the tomato",
    "Drizzle the mustard and olive oil over the prawns",
    "Season with salt and black pepper",
    "Sprinkle the chopped fresh dill over the top",
    "Fold the filo dough over the filling to form a triangle",
    "Cook the spanakopita for 5 minutes on each side, until golden brown"
